  "title": "TaskUs Announces Fiscal Third Quarter 2025 Results",
  "summary": "NEW BRAUNFELS, Texas–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Nov. 7, 2025– TaskUs, Inc. (Nasdaq: TASK), a leading provider of outsourced digital services and next-generation customer experience to the world’s most innovative companies, today announced its results for the third quarter ended September 30, 2025. “In the third quarter of 2025, we generated record revenue of $298.7 million, a year-over-year growth rate of 17.0%, led […]",
